help.prompt:
I am getting my laptop ready for a workshop and I am stuck. I have never used a terminal before.

My computer: {os}
My AI agent: {agent}
Where I am: {step}

This is the error I see:

{error}

Explain in plain words what went wrong, then tell me what to do next, one small step at a time. Do not suggest bypassing company policy, administrator restrictions, execution policy, TLS checks, proxies or security software. Use the organization's approved account and sign-in route, not a personal account to bypass a denial. If this needs approval or configuration, explain what to ask IT. Remind me to redact secrets and confidential details.
